{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/init(title:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"],"title":"Initializers","generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/body(content:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSToolBarTop\/ViewModifier-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","generated":true,"anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI12ViewModifierP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudstoolbartop"]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSToolBarTop","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents14OUDSToolBarTopV","platforms":[{"beta":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct","title":"OUDSToolBarTop"},"abstract":[{"text":"The top toolbar (aka ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"navigation bar"}]},{"text":" on iOS and iPadOS 18 and lower) sits at the top of the screen and provides contextual information","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and controls related to the current view.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It typically displays the page title, and may include navigation actions such as “Back” or “Close” as well as supplementary actions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can contain leading, principal (center, single item only), and trailing actions."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSToolBarTop"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": If an item is placed in principal position, the subtitle is never displayed (whatever ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is), because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".principal","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" placement only replaces the inline compact bar title, not ","type":"text"},{"code":".navigationSubtitle()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (iOS 26+), which would","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"otherwise keep rendering next to the item with no visible title next to it. The title itself is displayed only if ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasLargeTitle","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is ","type":"text"},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (in that case it appears below the bar, in large title mode, not inside it).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Appearances","text":"Appearances"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"With Liquid Glass \/ iOS 26+ the OS will change the rendering of the toolbar items depending to the context:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The OS can group the items of same types in one group with kind of rectangle (e.g. views with menus)"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"But for buttons items they will remain isolated"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The placement of the title can be leading or centered depending to the length of the text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The text can be truncated if there is not enough remaining space"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The OS can apply another style for the back button"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Without Liquid Glass \/ iOS 18 and lower, the OS won’t change that much the style of the toolbar items, Items won’t be visually grouped.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Globaly the appearence of the * navigation bar* elements is changed by the ","type":"text"},{"code":"oudsNavigationBarAppearance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"helper of ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" that must be applyed on the root view of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"NavigationStack","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for example.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Technical-constraints","text":"Technical constraints"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To be sure for iOS 18 and lower the back buttton and text have the good color, in your main view apply the following accent color:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    struct AppMainView: View {","        var body: some View {","            ContentView()","                .accentColor(theme.colors.contentDefault)","        }","    }"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Platform-considerations","text":"Platform considerations"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is available on iOS, iPadOS, and visionOS"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component is not available for watchOS, tvOS and macOS"}]}]}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Badges-uses","text":"Badges uses"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For iOS 26 with Liquid Glass, the system badge is used because the OUDS badge component does not provide a suitable","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rendering with the glassified effect applied on the top toolbar.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For iOS until 18 and without Liquid Glass  OUDS badge component is always used.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-sample","text":"Code sample"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    ContentView()","        .toolBarTop(\"Title\",","            leadingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(navigation: .back())","            },","            principalItem: OUDSToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"search\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Search\") { \/* Action to process *\/ },","            trailingItems: {","                OUDSToolBarItem(label: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","                OUDSToolBarItem(icon: Image(decorative: \"some_image\"), accessibilityLabel: \"Label\") { \/* Action to process *\/ }","            }","        )"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" helper can also be used to apply a SwiftUI toolbar configuration.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    toolBarTop(_:hasLargeTitle:subtitle:leadingItems:principalItem:trailingItems:)"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation","text":"Design documentation"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-ios-tool-bar-top","isActive":true,"type":"reference"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Themes-rendering","text":"Themes rendering"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Liquid-Glass","text":"Liquid Glass"},{"level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_light","type":"image"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Orange_dark","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Compact","text":"Orange Compact"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_light","type":"image"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_OrangeCompact_dark","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh","text":"Sosh"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Sosh_light","type":"image"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Sosh_dark","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe","text":"Wireframe"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_light","type":"image"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_LiquidGlass_Wireframe_dark","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Without-Liquid-Glass","text":"Without Liquid Glass"},{"level":4,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_Orange_light","type":"image"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"component_toolBarTop_Orange_dark","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"